+BOARD = """# Board
+
+## To do
+
+| # | Next move | Feature | Item | Waiting on |
+|---|---|---|---|---|
+| 56 | Design with you first | x | x | x |
+| 106 | Factory: buildable now | tag | x | x |
+| 117 | Factory: buildable now | marks | x | x |
+
+## Build in progress
